        <h2>Student Information</h2>
        <p class="about-bio">
          This project is part of the final practical exam for the **Essentials of NodeJS** course (SET01). 
          It implements a complete CRUD application for managing a tree catalog using Express, EJS, and MongoDB.
        </p>

        <div class="student-info-grid">
          <div class="info-label">Full Name:</div>
          <div class="info-value">Nguyễn Văn A</div>

          <div class="info-label">Student ID:</div>
          <div class="info-value">STUDENT_ID_T2508M</div>

          <div class="info-label">Class:</div>
          <div class="info-value">T2508M</div>

          <div class="info-label">Subject:</div>
          <div class="info-value">Essentials of NodeJS</div>

          <div class="info-label">Location:</div>
          <div class="info-value">Số 8, Tôn Thất Thuyết, Cầu Giấy, Hà Nội</div>

          <div class="info-label">School:</div>
          <div class="info-value">Aptech Hanoi Computer Education Center</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

